1 over 0.01.

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:39.940
Right?

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:41.960
And I, I can keep going, ok.

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:42.980
So,

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:45.540
There we go.

