1 divided by .01?

00:03:57.280 --> 00:03:59.840
Ok, allright, so you can see where this
is going.

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:00.660
Right?

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:04.100
So now this is a different kind of argument

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:07.600
but this, if it kept going,

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:13.060
it seems reasonable to say: "Welllll...

00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:14.280
Yeah?

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:15.860
Now this is interesting.

