00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:23.320
I've got the same answer.

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:24.560
Ok?

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:25.760
So this seems promising.

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:27.220
Seems promising.

00:04:28.420 --> 00:04:29.440
But there's a problem.

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:30.500
There's a big problem.

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:31.440
Ok?

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:33.420
And the problem is, you know,

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:35.340
this game, right, this game that I played

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:36.540
here with 1 divided by something and then

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:38.460
divided by other things, and so on.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:40.960
I can play with other numbers too, can't I?

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:42.140
For instance:

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:43.940
I could do it with 2.

00:04:44.780 --> 00:04:45.280
Right?

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:46.480
2 over .1.

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:48.080
2 over .01.

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:49.220
And so on.

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:49.760
Right?

